  "limits": [
    "Four page and four line actions per scene do not establish latency tails.",
    "The before package uses APP ABI36; after uses ABI37 with three extra public imports. Compiled non-Terminal C objects and resident C executable/data segments are identical; APP import thunks and relocation metadata change.",
